  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Tuntun Yadav & Ors vs The State Of Bihar on 10 December, 2013 Author: Akhilesh Chandra Bench: Akhilesh Chandra In The High Court Of Judicature At Patna Criminal Miscellaneous No.20656 of 2013 ====================================================== 1. Tuntun Yadav S/O Baleshwar Yadav Resident Of Nandlal Chapra, P.S. Ram Krishna Nagar, District Patna. 2. Dablu Yadav @ Dablu Kumar S/O Baleshwar Yadav Resident Of Nandlal Chapra, P.S. Ram Krishna Nagar, District Patna. 3. Jaibir Yadav @ Jaibir Kumar S/O Baleshwar Yadav Resident Of Nandlal Chapra, P.S. Ram Krishna Nagar, District Patna. 4. Shivjee Yadav S/O Rajendra Prasad Resident Of Mohalla East Laxminagar, Khemnichak, P.S. Ram Krishna Nagar, District Patna. .... .... Petitione Versus",
    "facts": "Petitioners apprehend their arrest in connection with a case for the offence punishable under sections 341, 323, 353, 427, 504/34 of the I.P.C. and sections 62, 63 and 31 of Food Safety and Standard Act, 2006, who are named accused in this case but only with assertion of having involvement without any specific accusation. Submission is of false implication, nothing specific against them, nor as is evident from order of the learned Sessions Judge, any attempt was made to show their conduct after getting its view through recording of C.C. T.V. Camera. Further petitioners carrying only three cases, namely, Ram Krishna Nagar P.S. Case No. 24 of 2012, Ram Krishna Nagar P.S. Case No. 39 of 2012 and Ram Krishna Nagar P.S. Case No. 68 of 2012, wherein they are on bail.",
